# No COOP/COEP in production: only the ZEOS Qwen 4B model needs a
# cross-origin isolated page, and it is listed only in local-models / stub
# dev mode, which astro.config.mjs `server.headers` isolates. Add the pair
# here (/* with Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin and
# Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless) when ZEOS ships.

/tour-data/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Access-Control-Allow-Methods: GET, HEAD, OPTIONS
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
